  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Hot For Teacher (w- Jay Fernandez)** (1 other source): A left-channel dropout around 4:07 in this song was repaired during editing [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **encore cheers**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Happy Birthday Claude**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1999-08-28.mk41.flacf** (recommended): source not stated; 35 songs; 184 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1999-08-28.mk41.flacf**: source: Schoeps MK41 > Schoeps VMS02IB > Casio DA-R100 > Sony TCD-D100 [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK41 microphones through a Schoeps VMS02IB preamp into a Casio DA-R100 and Sony TCD-D100 DAT recorders; Transfer chain: DAT master to first-generation DAT, then Tascam DA-20mkII to M-Audio Audiophile 2496, Sound Forge, WAV at 48k, and FLAC [1]",
